          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does Boswellia reduce inflammation?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Boswellia contains boswellic acids that inhibit 5-lipoxygenase (5-LOX), an enzyme involved in inflammatory processes. This mechanism helps reduce inflammation without the side effects commonly associated with conventional anti-inflammatory medications."
          }
        },
