          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What are the main health benefits of Boswellia?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Boswellia supports joint health and mobility, reduces chronic inflammation, may help with respiratory health, supports digestive wellness, and can help manage pain naturally. Research shows it's particularly effective for arthritis and inflammatory bowel conditions."
